troy in order to hit your targets and advance. Match 3 of the same color or eliminate massive amounts of boxes with special balls. Boxed will test your puzzle mind and your arm strength. Hop on in and get throwing", "short_description": "Boxed is a family friendly match 3 game. Every wonder what it would be in the full virtual world of your favorite mobile matching games? Enter the Matched Valley and go for your highest score!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://globeotter.com/ppolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Globe Otter", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://globeotter.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE", "STRATEGY", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4678660552246236"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974673_1905369259622055_5882675342186960298_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I9dSgN69n04Q7kNvwGT0GRm&_nc_oc=AdkZAKmhHScHq3Amm5joSmQblbSdO01-vmtZlY04FeM-oYPv8Xaw-j96UfKf2ckrgOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft_3r490Sg6SFsEm2PpK6Sb7n3JgFvkv-y2TLLCzJ-Tqg&oe=699DB1D7"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Boxed", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category":